+
+The level-up on that run came at charged frame 888 from exploration, not from a plan.
+The tier-1 explorer alone (`--policy explorer`, "tier-1 graph_explore only" per
+`scripts/arc_leaderboard_eval.py:113`; `sweep-3113164.partial.json`) reached r11l level 1
+in 768 actions. Six e3 runs (one partial) reached it in 813 to 815. So on r11l level 0 the
+LLM tier cost about 25,000 s and about 45 extra actions and returned nothing. That is one
+game and single seeds; it is the only game with a post-fix generator-channel record.
+
